<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The whispering pines in the forest so green;</l><l>A tree with a limb that can hold up a swing!</l><l>The geese who are honking, the robins that sing:</l><l>Are the wonderful works of Your hands!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The sun shining brightly just after the rain,</l><l>A field that is waving with golden grain;</l><l>The weather and seasons which You have ordained:</l><l>Are the wonderful works of Your hands!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The herbs and the plants and the flowers and trees,</l><l>The birds in the sky, the fish in the seas!</l><l>Plus animals, insects and people we see,</l><l>Are the wonderful works of Your hands!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
